{"id":"daraus","lemma":"daraus","pos":"adv","rank":1146,"glosses":["out of it, out of that, of it","hence, from that"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/1c/De-daraus.ogg/De-daraus.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Was machst du daraus?","en":"What do you make of that?","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"you"},null]},{"text":"Daraus wird nichts.","en":"Forget it!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/392417","words":[null,{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"nothing"}]},{"text":"Lasst uns das Beste daraus machen.","en":"Let's make the best of it.","words":[{"g":"to allow","l":"lassen"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"good","l":"gut"},null,{"g":"to make"}]},{"text":"Ich möchte keine große Sache daraus machen.","en":"I don't want to make a big deal out of this.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to like","l":"mögen"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},null,null,null,{"g":"to make"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"big deal"]]},{"text":"Ich mache mir nichts daraus.","en":"It doesn't worry me.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"nothing"},null]}]}